## Scope

Task 3.1b part (a) makes the English share captions for the 40 Storytime Level 2 unit 2
scripts of weeks 9 to 16. The work reads only English text. A first python extract removes
every Thai key and every Thai string before I see any week file.

## Steps

1. Extract the English from w01 to w16. Prove 0 Thai characters.
2. Read the rules: plan line 207, spec D14, loops spec FR-14 and D19, check code.
3. Write 40 caption rows and the English pack. Check the rows with python.
4. Commit the run files. Write this final block in its own commit.

## Thai rule

I am not a Claude model, so no Thai text may reach me (plan rule 19).

- I wrote the extract script first: `jr-green-t31b-extract-en.py`. It drops every `th` key and
